# #5841, part 2 of the fix removed. Pre-arm only: outside it the splitting activation
# has always claimed. It edits an operator, not an action.
MODULE: HandOffBoundBumpOnlyIfSplittingActivationClaimed
TARGET: HandOffBound
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a duplicate that claimed before the split, while the splitting activation was unarmed, is not superseded
BOUNDS: WithStaleDonor = TRUE, WithPreArm = TRUE, MaxWindows = 1

--- FIND
SplitBumps(read) == read > 0
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: only an armed splitting activation bumps.
SplitBumps(read) == liveArmed
--- END
